      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think the `!(is_win \u0026\u0026 is_component_build)` check in the previous implementation of `skia_enable_skottie` was preventing the second half of the `||` from ever being evaluated.\n\nSkottie is incompatible with \"is-component\" on any OS since it uses private API. I think the previous implementation was a de-facto `skia_enable_skottie \u003d true`, and if you were actually making a build with `is_win \u003d true` and `is_component_build \u003d true` you would hit a GN error that could be fixed by also adding `skia_enable_skottie \u003d false`.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 8,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 11,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "ada56a1f9bf3fc07f595c990573912ff703519dd",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
